{"id":"eba4d14b343d9469","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-self-reference-construction.md","title":"Self Reference Construction","display":"lem-self-reference-construction — Self Reference Construction","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-self-reference-construction","aliases":["92-lem-self-reference-construction"],"display":"lem-self-reference-construction — Self Reference Construction","depends_on":["[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-lem-diagonal-representable]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-fact-diagonal-computable]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103（PDF 119–120）；本地直接代入呈现","source_status":"原书内容的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-self-reference-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-self-reference-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-self-reference-construction — Self Reference Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"27fab6bb26120749\" href=\"?note=27fab6bb26120749\" title=\"92-lem-diagonal-representable\">92-lem-diagonal-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"659d57dcf656b1a5\" href=\"?note=659d57dcf656b1a5\" title=\"92-fact-diagonal-computable\">92-fact-diagonal-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103（PDF 119–120）；本地直接代入呈现"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d\">\\(\\widehat d\\)</span> (diagonal function and its total recursive extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\\)</span> (target formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal formula strongly representing the graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d\">\\(\\widehat d\\)</span>, supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"27fab6bb26120749\" href=\"?note=27fab6bb26120749\" title=\"92-lem-diagonal-representable\">92-lem-diagonal-representable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution and free-variable function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\exists\\eta_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\exists\\gamma_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\delta_d)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nG\\vdash\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\delta_d,\\bar n,v_0)\n\\leftrightarrow v_1=\\overline{\\widehat d(n)}\\Bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\eta_\\theta=\\exists v_1\\,(\\delta_d\\land\\theta),\\\\\n&amp;\\gamma_\\theta=\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\eta_\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner},v_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\gamma_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\\\\n&amp;G\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma_\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner},v_1)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\exists\\eta_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\exists\\gamma_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\delta_d)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nG\\vdash\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\delta_d,\\bar n,v_0)\n\\leftrightarrow v_1=\\overline{\\widehat d(n)}\\Bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\eta_\\theta=\\exists v_1\\,(\\delta_d\\land\\theta),\\\\\n&amp;\\gamma_\\theta=\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\eta_\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner},v_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\gamma_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\\\\\n&amp;G\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma_\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner},v_1)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\">\\(\\delta_d\\)</span>在对象语言中表示“第二个数是第一个数的对角代入结果”；外部图码集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_d\">\\(D_d\\)</span>不被当作公式应用</li>\n<li>将<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_\\theta\">\\(\\eta_\\theta\\)</span>自己的Gödel数以numeral形式无捕获地代回<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_\\theta\">\\(\\eta_\\theta\\)</span>，得到闭句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_\\theta\">\\(\\gamma_\\theta\\)</span></li>\n<li>因<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d\">\\(\\widehat d\\)</span>在合法公式码上等于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>，有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d(\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner)=\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner\">\\(\\widehat d(\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner)=\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner\\)</span>；强图表示遂给出最后的可证等价</li>\n<li>目标公式同样通过<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span>接收numeral，不能写成元语言式函数应用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner})\">\\(\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是自引用的核心构造</li>\n<li>用于Gödel/Löb/Henkin句子</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本地直接代入的自引用构造与原书强可定义对角函数机制对应。原书以包裹实例码操作证明同形结果；这里沿用本库的 Subst、素数幂编号与强图表示，不把具体字符串或编号当作相同。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103（PDF 119–120）；本地直接代入呈现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}